<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-03T17:58:01.363Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 17:58:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces, numbering about 2,000, are conducting a search for four soldiers missing after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince while denying any airstrikes. Haitian gang leaders have written to the United Nations asking for mediation and dialogue with security forces, with one leader saying he has &amp;quot;raised the white flag&amp;quot; and warning President Bukele about rising violence. The United Nations confirmed 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. These actions mark a shift from earlier reporting, adding a direct Salvadoran military presence and formal UN mediation requests by gang leaders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNcWpBblRQY1dfMzdMb2ZMTmVyZFROc1BqNF9DTXhpVTZsU01FQV9ISnMxaW1yZzJMYzBaeGFUYkhTb2JKTmF3ZXJ1TThFT1BrRVpSVTdTRlFCVkdmTXBNdTl3amM3UTI1MEpkM0lfb3VKYXNzSGFmTmpzZnlKazlPbU1tUkdEWllxMFpkMWl0ZVhDeExrN252NGxMNExFOFhDZ2ZLWHdVRkVxYXpzaDJycnRqSVlSU1hFMjZhSkd6WDBrYkJBMkdOMHI3bjE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQeFFIaW1Ya0Q0cVFzUkVrYWNQRzBZYktPQlpOVm1yeEVZYzhNT0RJNVdKVGMwbXUtZ1dtZHZBUXI2emF0d0tFSGU5NEoxd1diLUdJSERoNEw0d2twVHpNejI2ZXNzeC0zMGRlcC1BdkQ4MUk1WkNQQklReXF6bml3aGVOOEpmOG40MC1XV3FnLXp1d1JCVXNZRHFlYzVndGlxMFlDaElfU2lzYXRKZ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOc0swV0Z5MkJuU21TY0xEaEY5QzdsbUFGLVRwYlBDaDA4Znp1VWpjc1prbUloNTc2U3JVbk02LVRGTzB4X3lSaVppbXJ3RWtLanhkcm9GQkdtU0xFR3ZSMWttdmNFSXNxcVZyeDJxWnlTbUhEU2pHNXNROTlCeXlYcGdjY0prSUs2YWtRVTZOSk00R2Y5WHFHajVZUW9rRWtDbTEwcDNscW9wVkZjUlI0czA2V3k4Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Miami Herald&lt;/a